UID:gats-personal-t4--t4a-and-t5-slips-arrive@ghayurtax.com
DTSTAMP:20260919T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270228
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270301
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=2;BYMONTHDAY=-1
SUMMARY:T4\, T4A and T5 slips arrive
DESCRIPTION:Employers\, payers and banks must issue slips by the last day
  of February. If yours haven't arrived by the first week of March\, ask 
 for them. Who: Everyone. If a due date falls on a Saturday\, Sunday or p
 ublic holiday\, the CRA treats it as on time if received the next busine
 ss day. More: https://www.ghayurtax.com/key-dates.html
URL:https://www.ghayurtax.com/key-dates.html
CATEGORIES:GATS
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
