UID:gats-personal-personal-tax-instalment-due@ghayurtax.com
DTSTAMP:20260919T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261215
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261216
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=3,6,9,12;BYMONTHDAY=15
SUMMARY:Personal tax instalment due
DESCRIPTION:Instalments are required if your net tax owing is more than $
 3\,000 this year and was in either of the two previous years. The CRA se
 nds instalment reminders in February and August. Who: Self-employed\, la
 ndlords\, investors — anyone who owes more than $3\,000 at filing. If 
 a due date falls on a Saturday\, Sunday or public holiday\, the CRA trea
 ts it as on time if received the next business day. More: https://www.gh
 ayurtax.com/key-dates.html
URL:https://www.ghayurtax.com/key-dates.html
