DESCRIPTION:File your T1 and pay any balance. Self-employed people and th
 eir spouses have until June 15 to file\, but interest on a balance start
 s May 1. Who: Everyone (self-employed: payment due today\, return by Jun
 e 15). If a due date falls on a Saturday\, Sunday or public holiday\, th
